# Cloud sync. One URL: Neon derives both the auth service and the Data API from
# a project's base endpoint. It is public by design — a URL grants nothing on
# its own, because every row is behind row-level security keyed on the signed-in
# user. Delete this line and the game runs local-only.
#
# On Vercel, set the same variable under Settings -> Environment Variables.
VITE_NEON_URL=https://ep-quiet-firefly-ae3s1zgl.c-2.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb
